    [ '2026-11-23', 'Commissions', 'Fixed: paying the final invoice completed the order at once and emailed “on its way” before any tracking number existed. The order now stays Processing until you press Mark shipped, which sends that email with the tracking number.' ],
    [ '2026-11-23', 'Commissions', 'The “on its way” email for a line & wash commission now tells the customer how to frame it: the piece is on 9×12 paper and a faint pencil line marks the 8×10 area, their guide for an 8×10 mat or frame.' ],
